/Diode7 24 24 350 30 allthree
0.6 setgray
(true size, 8 pt: one unit per lamp) 24 266 label
1 0.18 0.1 setrgbcolor
/Diode7 8 200 266 (NEWS 7:30  The quick brown fox jumps) at
0.6 setgray
(DIODE5  -  lib/fonts/diode5.ps  -  5 lamps high, capitals only, every glyph at 20 pt (4 units per lamp)) 24 216 label
1 0.68 0.08 setrgbcolor
/Diode5 20 24 194 30 allthree
0.6 setgray
(A 65x5 strip at 5 pt as a raw grid \(square /DotSize 1 variant\), and at 6x with the strip outline) 24 60 label
1 0.68 0.08 setrgbcolor
/Diode5-Grid /Diode5 << /DotShape /square /DotSize 1 >> pf-variant
/Diode5-Grid 5 24 40 (HELLO 42 MON) at
0.25 setgray 0.5 setlinewidth
120 24 390 30 rectstroke
0.2 0.8 1 setrgbcolor
